es\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[virtual]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  provides the character to use as thousands separator <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(virtual protected member function of <code>std::moneypunct&lt;CharT,International&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/moneypunct/grouping\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>do_grouping</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[virtual]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  provides the numbers of digits between each pair of thousands separators <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(virtual protected member function of <code>std::moneypunct&lt;CharT,International&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/moneypunct/curr_symbol\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>do_curr_symbol</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[virtual]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  provides the string to use as the currency identifier <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(virtual protected member function of <code>std::moneypunct&lt;CharT,International&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/moneypunct/positive_sign\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>do_positive_sign</span><span>do_negative_sign</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[virtual]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  provides the string to indicate a positive or negative value <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(virtual protected member function of <code>std::moneypunct&lt;CharT,International&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/moneypunct/frac_digits\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>do_frac_digits</span></span></